From 37135de1eb4b8b21f61783ae083a368b823b899f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Oct 2024 14:15:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 050/913] plat-stm32mp1: allow probe on non-secure timers for
 stm32mp15 platforms

On stm32mp15x platforms, the CSI/HSI clocks calibration is based on timers
that cannot be secured but only MCU isolated. Therefore, allow the probe
of these devices for these platforms.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git a3ce261ce226aef86ab86929c366da59e2775b6e plat-stm32mp1: allow probe on non-secure timers for stm32mp15 platforms]
Change-Id: Ifdec99d35593c10acc32e7c992909f1b5a94d709
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/409757
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/main.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/main.c b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/main.c
index 9e4ef99ec..7ca9cbdec 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/main.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp1/main.c
@@ -573,7 +573,8 @@ bool stm32mp_allow_probe_shared_device(const void *fdt, int node)
 	if (node == uart_console_node ||
 	    !strcmp(compat, "st,stm32mp15-i2c-non-secure") ||
 	    (!strcmp(compat, "st,stm32-rng") &&
-	     IS_ENABLED(CFG_WITH_SOFTWARE_PRNG)))
+	     IS_ENABLED(CFG_WITH_SOFTWARE_PRNG)) ||
+	    (IS_ENABLED(CFG_STM32MP15) && !strcmp(compat, "st,stm32-timers")))
 		return true;
 
 	return false;
